 Shinsengumi. Taking her into custody and saving her, the Shinsengumi debate on what to do with Chizuru when they discover that she is the daughter of the doctor they are also looking for. So they decide to become Chizuru's protectors and help her look for her father (the doctor). Lots of events happen while she stays with the Shinsengumi, as they discover mysterious secrets and also fight against the Bakumatsu group. The story is overall romantic with a historical and political background.\n\n(Source: Hakuouki official website)"},"tags":[{"name":"Historical","rank":80,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Swordplay","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Male Cast","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Samurai","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Ensemble Cast","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Gore","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Adult Cast","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"War","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Vampire","rank":70,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Tragedy","rank":60,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Guns","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Harem","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Crossdressing","rank":40,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Hakuoki ~Demon of the Fleeting Blossom~","english":"Hakuoki ~Demon of the Fleeting Blossom~","native":"薄桜鬼","romaji":"Hakuouki","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"薄樱鬼"}]},"trailer":null,"visibility":"general"}